[{"title":"倾城误人身寄内翰洪丈","author":"朱涣","text":"倾城误人身，嗟哉难具陈。\n请君试侧耳，听妾歌其因。\n妾初未笄学新妆，肌理玉雪眉黛长。\n融怡窈袅销金裳，态浓意远夺目光。\n当时见者心为狂，共谓绝代惊非常。\n拟思昭阳奉君王，三千宠爱一身当。\n宁知事大缪，嫁作荡子妇。\n空闺独宿度芳华，蓬首乱鬓颜色朽。\n四海十年不相闻，一朝归来新閒旧。\n新閒旧，妾何有，摈妾不使侍箕帚。\n佳人多命薄，是事君信否。\n倾城误人身，古来唯有李夫人。\n延年作歌帝所珍，贮之金屋荐华茵。\n宠光杂遝疏弟昆，将死掩面留馀恩。\n千载不复见，言之涕沾巾。\n倾城误人身，此曲哀怨何可听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38605,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒夜曲","author":"朱涣","text":"寒夜夜政长，愁人背灯立。\n惊风摇竹树，栖鸟堕复集。\n山空接响多，室静虚白入。\n怊怅不成眠，残钟晓边急。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38606,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百岁令 寿丁大监","author":"朱涣","text":"瑞芳楼下，有花中君子，群然相聚。\n笑把筒露浥，来庆黄堂初度。\n净植无尘，清香近远，人与花名伍。\n六郎那得，这般潇洒襟宇。\n运了多少兵筹，依红泛绿，向俭池容与。\n歌裤方腾持节去，未许制衣湘楚。\n紫禁荷囊，玉堂莲炬，遍历清华处。\n归寻太乙，轻舟一叶江渚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38607,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"齐天乐 游洞岩记","author":"朱涣","text":"白云封断仙岩路，重重洞门深窈。\n翠竹笼烟，苍崖溅瀑，古木阴森回抱。\n坛空不老。\n锁一片莓苔，几丛莎草。\n试把桃源，较量风景是谁好。\n乘鸾人去已久，只今惟有，鹤飞猿啸。\n树拥香幢，泉敲玉佩，疑是群仙重到。\n尘氛可笑。\n久志慕丹台，梦思蓬岛。\n愿挹英游，细参梨与枣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38608,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题泠然洞 其一","author":"朱真人","text":"江山秀丽有奇峰，云水悠悠物外通。\n容足安夷寻达士，无缘寄语在乘风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38609,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题化龙山","author":"朱真人","text":"郭外郊西柳色芽，东流注目浩无涯。\n江明白白红红树，春在三三两两家。\n几度来临逢社燕，一樽相对到昏鸦。\n此邦物色吟成画，高谢山中景致嘉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38610,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题泠然洞 其二","author":"朱真人","text":"不踏轻红尘，扁舟寄此身。\n江湖双短鬓，天地一閒人。\n换酒穿红鲤，调羹芼紫莼。\n醉来歌一曲，流韵满青蘋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38611,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入山采药遇异人","author":"朱真静","text":"紧著芒鞋高系裙，野猿相狎许同群。\n绿萝林里采茶去，踏碎青山一片云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38612,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又题座右窗间","author":"朱真静","text":"经书不是语虚无，荆棘丛中有坦涂。\n不遇至人真口诀，误人错下死工夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38613,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石室庵夜坐","author":"朱真静","text":"青灯寒焰弄微明，灯与幽人一样清。\n案上黄庭浑懒看，时闻败叶打窗声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38614,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题石室庵前竹上","author":"朱真静","text":"十年身与鬼为邻，曾见岩花几度春。\n莫怪柴门终日闭，怕将尘事恼閒人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38615,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临终偈","author":"朱真静","text":"去来如一，真性湛然。\n风收云散，月在青天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38616,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"朱继芳","text":"儿女穿针夜向分，楼头月落尚炉薰。\n凭谁为觅机边石，留取支床卧白云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38617,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太极图","author":"朱继芳","text":"动静无端画一圈，分明擘破又浑全。\n日光漏得先天意，钻入书窗个个圆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38618,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"见野祭者","author":"朱继芳","text":"饧粥初香未赐烟，百金难买过湖船。\n南屏山下何年骨，犹向人间觅纸钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38619,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东菑","author":"朱继芳","text":"东菑足时雨，离离半青黄。\n田家不待穫，小摘炊新香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38620,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扬州","author":"朱继芳","text":"金陵王气水东流，流到东淮古岸头。\n夜半一声天上曲，锦帆天子下扬州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38621,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"尘外","author":"朱继芳","text":"尘飞不到处，山色入芒屦。\n乘兴一长吟，回头已忘句。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38622,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次意一先生仙霞壁间韵","author":"朱继芳","text":"回首仙源隔彩霞，丛祠攫肉有饥鸦。\n贞元朝士重来晚，不见桃花见菜花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38623,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵胡仲方因杨伯子见寄 其二","author":"朱继芳","text":"楚渡食萍应甚美，舜祠吹玉直能清。\n二君即日青冥上，唯我青山带雨耕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38624,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"行都春事诗","author":"朱继芳","text":"紫陌无泥雨后天，绿阴多处正鞦韆。\n土风未必知农事，也听村夫说种田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38625,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观化","author":"朱继芳","text":"看见青虫作蝶时，不知蝶是此身非。\n床头为有南华卷，午枕酣来忽梦飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38626,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"听雪","author":"朱继芳","text":"瓦沟初瑟瑟，隐几坐虚白。\n良久却无声，门前深几尺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38627,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴歌","author":"朱继芳","text":"雁影江潭底，秋声浦溆间。\n吴儿歌一曲，月子几回弯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38628,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张子中牡丹图","author":"朱继芳","text":"写来犹是挟春娇，想见当年魏与姚。\n花外小车看未了，杜鹃声里洛阳桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38629,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"辛亥二月望祭斋宫因游甘园 其五","author":"朱继芳","text":"公事相妨一半春，今朝才得自由身。\n眼中领略能多少，细雨斜风便妒人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38630,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"辛亥二月望祭斋宫因游甘园 其一","author":"朱继芳","text":"山入湖光碧四围，棋枰零落葑田稀。\n蒲芽短短鸳鸯冷，惟有渔师几网归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38631,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"辛亥二月望祭斋宫因游甘园 其二","author":"朱继芳","text":"朝霏作雨连天湿，春气熏人到骨香。\n四望水亭无正面，有花多处背湖光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38632,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"辛亥二月望祭斋宫因游甘园 其三","author":"朱继芳","text":"海棠阴下小徘徊，屐齿深深一径苔。\n忽听铜钲花外近，园丁说是主人来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38633,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"辛亥二月望祭斋宫因游甘园 其四","author":"朱继芳","text":"老眼看花兴未厌，不知头上雨廉纤。\n流莺浪语春风恨，谁拗花枝插帽檐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38634,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其五 山居","author":"朱继芳","text":"半屋云霞与鹿分，两株古木正当门。\n野花自落东流水，坐对青山酒一樽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38635,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其七 山居","author":"朱继芳","text":"宿世仙家十二楼，误婴时网未深愁。\n浮丘辈行如相觅，骑却紫云归去休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38636,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其二 山居","author":"朱继芳","text":"空山薇蕨供清斋，世事悠悠不挂怀。\n梅溽得风醒午枕，竹阴转日上南阶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38637,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其三 山居","author":"朱继芳","text":"白云缥缈野人家，丹事年来渐有涯。\n不与世人争岁月，却将椿菌勘南华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38638,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其四 山居","author":"朱继芳","text":"宿雨初乾一杖藜，欲呼渔艇访前溪。\n碧桃花落无寻处，惆怅人间日又西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38639,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其六 山居","author":"朱继芳","text":"好山当户四无邻，似是秦时采药人。\n千百年间天地里，不多不少一闲身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38640,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其一 山居","author":"朱继芳","text":"春到寒荄总向荣，药苗旋种亦初成。\n山翁幸自无谁识，可要山中宰相名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38641,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其八 山居","author":"朱继芳","text":"种药千畦手自锄，年来渐喜识人疏。\n等闲旋点黄金卖，莫讶家无檐石储。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38642,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其十 山居","author":"朱继芳","text":"拥树溪云迷近远，低檐山果乱红青。\n莫言身外都无事，早晚焚香看道经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38643,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其九 山居","author":"朱继芳","text":"矮窗攲枕看朝荣，老觉迎逢礼数生。\n来往颇知麋鹿性，寒暄不会俗人情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38644,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其七 边庭","author":"朱继芳","text":"苍苔白骨满黄沙，马汗成冰带雪花。\n夜夜鞘中长铗吼，教人不得梦还家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38645,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其五 边庭","author":"朱继芳","text":"征夫战骨洒桑乾，帐下苍头自转官。\n一骑红尘天外落，筹功更说几多般。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38646,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其三 边庭","author":"朱继芳","text":"一剑沙场独苦辛，天阴杀气作黄尘。\n沉思鸟尽弓无用，肘后累累却顾身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38647,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其九 边庭","author":"朱继芳","text":"虏退边方得暂宁，枣儿红近莫休兵。\n汉家错信和亲议，不见胡雏与父争。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38648,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其十 边庭","author":"朱继芳","text":"北风吹骨最酸辛，白面书生四角巾。\n战士总成亡命鬼，将军才是有功人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38649,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其四 边庭","author":"朱继芳","text":"探使归来半信疑，帐前相语怕人知。\n沉香雾里娇弦暖，莫遣边愁到两眉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38650,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其六 边庭","author":"朱继芳","text":"公主琵琶胡地秋，将军刁斗汉关愁。\n相逢老病无依卒，未说沙场泪已流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38651,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其八 边庭","author":"朱继芳","text":"有客新从塞上回，解包收得战场灰。\n营家未敢分明哭，请看刀痕始欲哀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38652,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其四 农桑","author":"朱继芳","text":"编茅为屋荻为帘，老小团栾苦乐兼。\n乐岁输丁犹未了，饥年家口更堪添。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38653,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其五 农桑","author":"朱继芳","text":"头白村翁尚把锄，瓶中那复斗升储。\n午餐减与饥乌食，却愧家人问有馀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38654,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其六 农桑","author":"朱继芳","text":"四月官场入纳时，乡耆旁午上门追。\n请看贫妇通宵织，身上曾无挂一丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38655,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其七 农桑","author":"朱继芳","text":"肠随丝断手生胝，羡杀星边织女机。\n借问输官零落否，儿郎寒冷且无衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38656,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其十 农桑","author":"朱继芳","text":"带得鸡豚趁晓虚，荒村牢落数家居。\n一家幸是田园主，留与儿孙写契书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38657,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其九 农桑","author":"朱继芳","text":"客户耕田主户收，螟蝗水旱百般忧。\n及秋幸有黄云割，债主相煎得自由。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38658,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其二 农桑","author":"朱继芳","text":"妇馌耕夫日尚长，碓声呜咽宿舂粮。\n寻思一饭何时饱，秧种青青麦未黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38659,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其八 农桑","author":"朱继芳","text":"农父眉头百念攒，雨愁烂死旱愁乾。\n龙神社鬼烧香遍，不到秋成睡得安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38660,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其一 农桑","author":"朱继芳","text":"裹饭驱儿候暖耕，塍泥滑滑不堪行。\n如何说得农家苦，雨笠风蓑过一生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38661,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其三 朱门","author":"朱继芳","text":"曲池毕竟有平时，冷眼看他炙手儿。\n十数年间三易主，焉知来者复为谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38662,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其一 朱门","author":"朱继芳","text":"红雨声乾未作泥，绣成十里绿杨堤。\n金杯缓劝玲珑唱，玉勒催归腰袅嘶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38663,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其二 朱门","author":"朱继芳","text":"晋代豪华不数家，万钱下箸未为奢。\n客来只是家常饭，豆粥萍齑费咄嗟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38664,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其六 朱门","author":"朱继芳","text":"朱门往事若为怀，积雨苔痕绿上阶。\n几处败砖吟蟋蟀，玉人曾此溜金钗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38665,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其七 朱门","author":"朱继芳","text":"百斛明珠米在仓，沉香火底捻银簧。\n人生行乐那须许，多少边兵未有粮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38666,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其四 朱门","author":"朱继芳","text":"客履三千此托身，晚杯狐白暖生春。\n狂来且置兴亡事，金坞铜陵不解贫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38667,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其八 朱门","author":"朱继芳","text":"泥金摺损舞衣罗，蹙破遥山皓齿歌。\n此曲人间听不得，莫愁还自有愁多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38668,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其十 朱门","author":"朱继芳","text":"长楸走马却归来，雉挟春骄未应媒。\n不信杏梁双燕语，日长帘幕有风开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38669,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其五 朱门","author":"朱继芳","text":"天近偏承雨露荣，深深庭院锁清明。\n柳丝风送鞦韆影，墙外行人空复情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38670,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其九 朱门","author":"朱继芳","text":"中寿知无满百身，暖歌冷舞及青春。\n黄金不买长生药，白发偏惊快活人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38671,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其九 负薪","author":"朱继芳","text":"扪萝缘壁到山头，俯羡鸿飞尽自由。\n风雨萧萧黄叶滑，未行十步两三休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38672,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其二 负薪","author":"朱继芳","text":"薪樗塞破野人居，此是糇粮卒岁储。\n客里黄金燃桂尽，厨无烟火欲何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38673,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其七 负薪","author":"朱继芳","text":"腰镰上到白云边，惆怅长松不尽年。\n近市山山皆有主，远山高峭步难前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38674,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其十 负薪","author":"朱继芳","text":"黄昏樵采早回归，同伴相邀未有期。\n抱子老妻门口望，南山有虎悔何追。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38675,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其四 负薪","author":"朱继芳","text":"破帽笼头发半华，樵歌一曲胜长嗟。\n鸡鸣裹饭登高去，日暮天寒未到家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38676,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其三 负薪","author":"朱继芳","text":"烂柯人去隔存亡，一局棋终怆故乡。\n想得山中绝烟火，松花松子当乾粮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38677,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其一 负薪","author":"朱继芳","text":"三千门馆蹑珠宾，半百还家衣锦身。\n却是吏民私告语，十年前是卖薪人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38678,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和颜长官百咏 其八 负薪","author":"朱继芳","text":"蒸梨炊黍付荆妻，指点青山涧水西。\n忽听丁丁云外斧，一声山鸟背人啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38679,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]